@@ -1803,6 +1803,37 @@
       "valid_conditions": "qwen4exp QSA layers (indexer top-k, compress ratio 4), one sequence, token ubatches. Multi-sequence or 2d-position embedding ubatches fall back to full pooling (previous cost).",
       "notes": "Lane 301 DECISIONS D11, D13, D17: board/programs/local-inference/lanes/2026-10-05-lane-301-*.md. Stacks on vulkan-fa-sparse-prefill-qsa (both arms carried it).",
