+    {
+      "id": "vulkan-moe-gather-slot-major-matvec-id",
+      "status": "active",
+      "_registered": "2026-10-05, lane-302 (Opus 5.5). Registered as an OP-LEVEL win that ships DEFAULT OFF. The served A/B (cellB-10051832) FAILED its pre-registered read rule (round 2 pairs -1.5..-2.8%), so no served t/s win may be quoted from this entry.",
+      "mechanism": "MUL_MAT_ID small-batch mat-vec (n_tokens 2..8) gets gather pipelines whose linear workgroup id maps to (row block = linear / nslots, slot = linear % nslots): consecutive workgroups are the routed slots of one weight row block, so slots that picked the same expert read that row block from L2 instead of DRAM. Per-workgroup math is unchanged (a permutation of work order), so output is byte-identical to the old path. GGML_ARIFI_MOE_GATHER unset = old path; =1 = slot-major gather (the measured width); =2/4 = multi-column variants that lose at real routing (padded-column ALU).",
+      "commit": "088636633d",
+      "also_commits": [
+        "16eb17b431",
+        "2346a2b045",
+        "c0eac97305",
+        "fe8da30014"
+      ],
+      "protected_paths": [
