+      "workload": "Qwen3.8-Flash-Next qwen4exp IQ3_S serve file MoE experts (IQ4_NL down, IQ2_S / IQ3_XXS / IQ3_S / IQ4_XS gate-up), 512 experts top-10, AMD Radeon 890M (RDNA3.5), MTP verify width 4.",
+      "measured_effect": "Op level, timed pass 100 reps, g1/g0 us per op at real routing n4 / n8: IQ4_NL 0.93/0.92, IQ2_S 0.94/0.91, IQ3_XXS 0.81/0.77, IQ3_S 0.90/0.83, IQ4_XS 0.73/0.65 (cellA-10051633). Perf logger main_b4 (85 verify graphs) g1/off: IQ2_S 0.79, IQ3_XXS 0.83, IQ3_S 0.86, IQ4_NL 0.88 vs untouched control q2_0 0.88 and non-MUL_MAT_ID graph time 0.97 (run-level offset; only IQ2_S/IQ3_XXS/IQ3_S drop clearly beyond the q2_0 control). Served decode: NOT shown.",
+      "valid_conditions": "Vulkan MUL_MAT_ID mat-vec id path, n_tokens 2..8, opt-in env. n_tokens 1 never reaches the gather (plain decode measured -1.3..+2.3%, single round). Q2_0 down (q8_1 MMVQ id pipeline) has no gather variant."
